WEBVTT

1
00:00:01,710 --> 00:00:07,820
Shi Yin, you have understood it a long time ago, right?

2
00:00:07,820 --> 00:00:12,970
Yes, I have always thought, just hold on until rescue comes.

3
00:00:12,970 --> 00:00:16,640
Without Lin Feng, we can still live our lives

4
00:00:16,640 --> 00:00:19,640
Now I know I can't make it through

5
00:00:19,640 --> 00:00:24,300
From the day of the first ticket, I can’t survive

6
00:00:24,300 --> 00:00:28,200
What we do is both responsible and conscientious

7
00:00:29,200 --> 00:00:32,520
It's all my fault, not only did I not stop Weiwei

8
00:00:32,520 --> 00:00:36,550
He also assisted in the curse and made Lin Feng work as a coolie like a dog.

9
00:00:36,550 --> 00:00:41,890
So some accounts must be paid

10
00:00:41,890 --> 00:00:43,890
something must be done

11
00:00:43,890 --> 00:00:46,180
Is it too late now?

12
00:00:46,180 --> 00:00:50,550
As long as you have the will, it's never too late
